WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
No Chaser whiffs over the knocked-down Ryu.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.000
Standing heavy kick hits Ryu as he rises.

3
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.650
Crouching heavy punch links after the heavy kick.

4
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:03.650
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.500
Light Rising Uppercut completes the conversion.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.350
Luke lands after the light Uppercut.
